<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Lembrete de Prazo</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;background:#f4f4f4;margin:0;padding:0}.container{max-width:600px;margin:20px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFA500,#FF8C00);color:#fff;padding:30px;text-align:center}.content{padding:30px}.button{display:inline-block;background:#FFA500;color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;font-weight:600}.footer{background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#666}.footer a{color:#0066CC;text-decoration:none}.warning-box{background:#FFF3E0;border-left:4px solid #FFA500;padding:15px;margin:20px 0;border-radius:4px}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="header"><h1>⏰ Lembrete de Prazo</h1></div>
<div class="content">
<h2>Prazo se Aproximando</h2>
<p>A denúncia <strong>{{protocol}}</strong> possui um prazo próximo do vencimento.</p>
<div class="warning-box">
<p><strong>Denúncia:</strong> {{title}}</p>
<p><strong>Prazo:</strong> {{formatDate deadline}}</p>
<p><strong>Dias Restantes:</strong> {{daysRemaining}} dia(s)</p>
</div>
<center><a href="{{url}}" class="button">Ver Denúncia</a></center>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#666;margin-top:30px">
Por favor, tome as ações necessárias antes do vencimento do prazo.
</p>
</div>
<div class="footer">
<p><strong>{{appName}}</strong></p>
<p><a href="{{appUrl}}">Acessar Sistema</a> | <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">Suporte</a></p>
<p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}.</p>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
